  m_Text: "\u2022  Follow the cards at the bottom to complete the lesson.\n\u2022 
    Each row / column on the 4\xD74 board has 2 suns and 2 moons.\n\u2022  \xD7 means
    opposite, = means same; never 3 identical in a row."
